      "ArticleTitle": "Failure of methylprednisolone to prevent nonuniform cardiac accelerator nerve discharge associated with coronary occlusion-induced arrhythmia: evidence against prostaglandin modulation of autonomic cardioaccelerator neural discharge in the anesthetized cat.",
